          "heading": "Jake White names four uncapped Fiji players for Saturday's Japan Test",
          "body": "Jake White's first Fiji squad for the Japan Test has four uncapped players, with Nacani Boginisoko and Aporosa Vuniyayawa both starting. Peni Naruma and Kavekini Boselawa could win their debuts off the bench, and Isaiah Armstrong-Ravula starts at fly-half with Tevita Ikanivere captaining. It is the first time the sides have met since Japan beat Fiji 20-15 in September's Pacific Nations Cup final, and the test opens preparation for November's Nations Championship matches against France, Ireland and Italy."
