          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Galthié calls up South African-born Jeremy Ward despite France's injury crisis",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié has named Jeremy Ward, a South African-born Stade Français player, in France's 42-man squad for the November Nations Championship matches, even as the coach works through a growing injury list. Ward, a former Junior Springboks captain, cannot play for France until residency rules allow next year, so his call-up is for training purposes, reports say. It comes as Ramos, Jalibert, Marchand and Meafou are all sidelined, with Nicolas Depoortere dropped to make room."
