          "body": "Ireland coach Andy Farrell's squad for the autumn internationals, named on Wednesday, includes Ulster's Jamie Benson, who joined the province from Harlequins over the summer. Benson previously played for England up to U20 level, but he could now wear green at test level, and his call-up comes only a few months after his move to Ulster."
