          "heading": "Former Scotland winger Tim Visser to stand trial on rape charges",
          "body": "Former Scotland winger Tim Visser is to go on trial accused of controlling, abusing and raping a woman. The 39-year-old, who won 33 caps for Scotland, faces four charges covering alleged incidents in Edinburgh, Surrey and the Netherlands over 14 years, two of them alleging rape, including one claiming he had sex with her after consent was withdrawn. A further charge alleges he took intimate images of her without consent. The trial will be held in Edinburgh."
