          "heading": "World Rugby names Pierre Brousset to referee Wallabies' Test against England",
          "body": "World Rugby has named France's Pierre Brousset to referee the Wallabies' next Test, away to England at Allianz Stadium in London. Australia's stake is pointed: former captain Michael Hooper has already criticised Andrea Piardi over the Perth Test against South Africa, in which the Wallabies were reduced to 11 men after four sin-binnings. Piardi has been given France v South Africa in the November window, and Brousset now takes charge of a match that will shape Australia's standing after back-to-back Bledisloe defeats."
