          "heading": "Brodie Retallick rules out All Blacks return while overseas policy stands",
          "body": "Brodie Retallick has closed the door on an All Blacks return, telling the Sportscafe Legends podcast the Kobe Steelers lock will not be considered for Test rugby. \"Until they change the rules, it's not even a possibility, so I'm not even going to entertain it,\" said the 35-year-old, who is playing in Japan with two seasons left on his Kobe contract. Head coach Dave Rennie had been open about wanting him back, but Retallick's last Test was the 2023 World Cup final."
